        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Steven Johnson, Mohammad Bakri, Evan Daugherty, John Travolta, Robert De Niro\n- Films: Killing Season\n- Companies: Millennium Films\n- Roles: screenwriter, film director, producer, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Steven Johnson was born on October 30, 1964, and he is an American screenwriter, film director, and producer.\n- Mohammad Bakri was born in 1953, and he is an Arab-Israeli actor and film director.\n- Killing Season, previously titled Shrapnel, is a 2013 American action thriller film.\n- Evan Daugherty wrote Killing Season.\n- Mark Steven Johnson directed Killing Season for Millennium Films.\n- Killing Season was the first on-screen pairing of John Travolta and Robert De Niro.",
